{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Scope exhaustion behavior to the built-in strategy.** `WaitForConditionConfig` has no `max_attempts`; only a strategy produced by `create_wait_strategy(WaitStrategyConfig(...))` raises on exhaustion. A custom strategy can continue indefinitely unless it enforces its own limit, so the current wording may leave migrated workflows polling forever.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7o8Jo1","finding_digest":"c7d6a91caf5d0312ac02e8b849c4c156d9df1c3da7a24bac28a523c51bb6b977","finding_id":"arf_v1_y7lkshfplubrflac5c4etrgbk3","finding_key":"docs/migration-1.x-to-2.x.md::wait-for-condition-exhaustion::custom-strategy-limit-ownership","identity_key":"docs/migration-1.x-to-2.x.md::wait-for-condition-exhaustion::custom-strategy-limit-ownership","line":180,"observation_digest":"556877beca3d9eebe9d1af388e4e8111db89476e8426f86a2cee245e725b1f35","observation_id":"aro_v1_kvuhppwkhwpox2orv44i4tubch","path":"docs/migration-1.x-to-2.x.md","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T20:20:55Z","review_id":"arr_v1_6q22ccaf2z5sttphbjnlbskryq","reviewed_base_sha":"ae73e73a9749d8faf73fc5530ce0429a70a5a725","reviewed_head_sha":"ea3ae4884dcd84d9c1d47eb03121c61c437f7f6e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":176,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_m5bmww7wrt53ujfkruz4uuyp4y"},"pull_request":{"number":655},"record_id":"art_v1_lz7mvhncktfmptxz3lrjgogsqg","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T20:20:55Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
